Local file Upload Functionality in SAP.
How to download Excel file with XLSX.


*C--Parameters ****************************************************************************
PARAMETERS: p_dfile TYPE localfile.

*C--Get F4 Value request. *****************************************************************
AT SELECTION-SCREEN ON VALUE-REQUEST FOR p_dfile.


*C-- File open dialog *****************************************************************

    DATA: lt_file_table TYPE filetable,
          ls_file_table TYPE file_table,
          lv_rc         TYPE i,
          lv_extension  TYPE string,
          lv_filter     TYPE string.

    lv_extension = c_xls.
    lv_filter    = text-015.   "Excel File(*.XLS;*.XLSX;*.XLSM)|*.XLS;*.XLSX;*.XLSM

    CALL METHOD cl_gui_frontend_services=>file_open_dialog
      EXPORTING
        default_extension       = lv_extension
        file_filter             = lv_filter
      CHANGING
        file_table              = lt_file_table
        rc                      = lv_rc
      EXCEPTIONS
        file_open_dialog_failed = 1
        cntl_error              = 2
        error_no_gui            = 3
        not_supported_by_gui    = 4
        OTHERS                  = 5.
    IF sy-subrc IS INITIAL.
      READ TABLE lt_file_table INTO ls_file_table INDEX 1.
      IF sy-subrc = 0.
        me_file = ls_file_table-filename.
      ENDIF.
    ELSE.
      MESSAGE ID sy-msgid TYPE sy-msgty NUMBER sy-msgno
               WITH sy-msgv1 sy-msgv2 sy-msgv3 sy-msgv4.
    ENDIF.



